,"body":"Noticed #108010 got merged, but it's completely broken as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108010#discussion_r2182325781 was never addressed, the scale is still being added. 🙃\r\n\r\nWhile at it I've changed it to:\r\n- Not rely on changing rotation, which is not precise (regardless whether using degrees/radians), contrary to directly applying flips/transpose to basis axes.\r\n- Apply whole cell transform at once, including the cell position.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNote that currently placing a scene tile with non-default transform flags will throw an error, as tranforms flags are not ignored from the id here:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/scene/resources/2d/tile_set.cpp#L5852-L5855\r\n\r\nBut seems it needs to be handled properly in few other places as well. Leaving it for another PR, should be probably resolved at once with #112175.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112790/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confu